#: badend:badend_426E9937_1441_47ED_B630_0214FA99B000
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9217c1afee3671d1734e12330cd4da3edfcdf7fc21b310fd20c7b7250fa123d8
#. default-sha256: 40e7bf8ef838018d57ff3198eaa3103216e0bcacd0cb73dd3b81f907f7bca383
msgctxt "badend:badend_426E9937_1441_47ED_B630_0214FA99B000"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫She was absolutely right."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫——她所说的话，⟪k:19⟫是理所当然的。"

#: badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01a56994dd9e330ceffcbfee48adbeaaf81c1f71617799a278beeeeda53d236e
#. default-sha256: a398ceaf975112bef4952ee9e921c5dc98310b8035411abe34133131f81a5b38
msgctxt "badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had seen an excess of tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫迄今为止，⟪k:1⟫「⟪k:2⟫你⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」已经看过了太多的悲剧。"

#: badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62a47dfd6e799ee07fabedd16659cd1b2b1b5ddbee0adad5e9ef5b5f7eaa98f0
#. default-sha256: 1b2a981b18ac3899e2a7fcf6f8f4020d612e0ce010c166708621f8e35f1eb55d
msgctxt "badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had borne witness to far too much pain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫目睹了太多痛心之事。"

#: badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62e122927a5b178ff3185ccc49fdf880a5ccf93514b907804fc3873aa7aa11eb
#. default-sha256: b823873980a298e30588e98009ebc6e888f335f06246e3cc78c2dae18b7651a7
msgctxt "badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫his⟪k:3⟫ spirit was deeply wounded by it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫连「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」的心都深受其伤……"

#: badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48f0efda06c7c84dbedf89ce3c38a403fcfab64f4779f8597ed32e0cd9d4f3d5
#. default-sha256: d5242d756c37c2fe716370dad3350d321bce78aedbe890b4b952b4b5af71555a
msgctxt "badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ could not possibly endure any further tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫已经无法再忍受更多的悲剧。⟪k:1⟫"

#: badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 982440b0d0a7cc1bedd68244dd2ea63be99f2ee73ffb7e99a438b2e14d454d39
#. default-sha256: e246c6b0de6df9403a87c2565904d4ade23488eae9f7b79210ea316412706f4c
msgctxt "badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And so, if she was offering ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ relief from all that, perhaps ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫"
"he⟪k:6⟫ should accept it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因此……⟪k:1⟫如果交由她来守护的话，⟪k:2⟫只需要顺从其意就可以了。"

#: badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f58abfb69a61c35f0004882d6088d58bd2dc56eaa3c14961ce172e90bf9598c
#. default-sha256: e9b9c75c7db3ab5f92891b5aa25f9de756dac6f55b0267cc8c63033c9e52d12e
msgctxt "badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had guided ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ this far, never letting go of ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫毕竟，⟪k:1⟫一直是她在牵引着「⟪k:2⟫你⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」——"

#: badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 507607ebf5cd8d36572563fedbc7e5315dc76ff6dc18ce6d8a0f9b71d5a7d8d9
#. default-sha256: bf1ed3930cff95fd3526b1527e9556ee44acd519d58cfbba278fdbbd5e6f9952
msgctxt "badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it was her presence that had allowed ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ to bear the bleak, "
"disheartening, and wretched tales ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫he⟪k:6⟫ saw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫当那些时而忧郁、⟪k:1⟫时而凄惨、⟪k:2⟫时而残忍的故事呈现在眼前时，⟪k:3⟫都得益于她始终握着的手，"
"⟪k:4⟫才能走到现在。"

#: badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fda55c71f35567eddfcecaeb3b4715cd882ee37f69578ea015a6b85ebfeaacf2
#. default-sha256: 7eac9fb7551f8cf4d9dd76410ee2ce803fa635cf01137cfbed970adb98ff6a80
msgctxt "badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ really need anything other than her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫对「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」来说，⟪k:5⟫除她以外已经别无所求了。"

#: badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27ab9610542db9ed10aff21f05e2c56b17dfcdf052cbfbe2c44ea9d0d077bf69
#. default-sha256: 0d1f494d66d870848a3f5478e97b8d4544121a9f275ee7cd3d54231cef6ea737
msgctxt "badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If she said she wanted to be with ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以，如果她对「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」是如此期望着的话。"

#: badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eccf110400d230a4d6e28da9fa8ead6c25492de690c921e0bbff8800de48ba98
#. default-sha256: ba82feb1741349a239ac05fa70006e299ae5dace7f4bab8391cb7c4ea30618cb
msgctxt "badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then surely ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ allowed to want the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那么，「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」又何尝不是如此期望着她的呢？"

#: badend:badend_DA85CFA1_92FA_46A7_9F1A_A7666E361742
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c3f46be42a8839e616a1d9c4f6a3e52e8881739706f5c30b138df4384900fec
#. default-sha256: 6f4eee08c9a01e14033251badbc078f0c9e14caa303346ada199df25c6c408fc
msgctxt "badend:badend_DA85CFA1_92FA_46A7_9F1A_A7666E361742"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Grasp my hand, Master...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Come, hold it tight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那么，⟪k:3⟫老爷……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫请牵住……⟪k:6⟫下仆的手吧。"

#: badend:badend_3915BB6B_3C00_441F_BA02_CACC127487F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 505e994da252d1817af7bbae16e59273c9d8a150a3f14087ef1a8725c5293567
#. default-sha256: 707bba7ccc0ce4355527d86a6981fd7059e9a0edbdbe64c78181083a1d08e574
msgctxt "badend:badend_3915BB6B_3C00_441F_BA02_CACC127487F6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ gently wrapped ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ fingers around the "
"Maid’s cold hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫于是，「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」温柔地握住了女仆冰冷的手。"

#: badend:badend_C2FB14B1_07D8_4207_929D_EC8C5B7A68BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee19dd7df604c9a7692eeb64e14f007cc5a6edef5ba075df3c0972518f2a2c52
#. default-sha256: efe4531258f37c2798a84af652108c9a9c8bd0bfd55c5c750f42948051fe38ff
msgctxt "badend:badend_C2FB14B1_07D8_4207_929D_EC8C5B7A68BD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to let go."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫再也……⟪k:1⟫不会松开这只手了。"

#: badend:badend_BAE7E41B_D276_4CB9_A2B2_44C4AA1DC088
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b67fd3580a14248dbd1bcd169dc9d71983f87702f66d9e645a3a5dbb6848657f
#. default-sha256: 1a8a3639460ca5a6ad8d7267bea704cdf708606eabe5fa502f700c2914957151
msgctxt "badend:badend_BAE7E41B_D276_4CB9_A2B2_44C4AA1DC088"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫再也……⟪k:1⟫不要去回想了。"

#: badend:badend_74649044_6D3B_42E9_91BB_EC8BBFACE885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 321dc457e8e6a1eb8fcf7afc6e7db81bb1d963a777a40e8fb321c36276aa5673
#. default-sha256: 30ea4125ebe4e890d0872734ef424983c4a67720df01840b0e34de7bab7196aa
msgctxt "badend:badend_74649044_6D3B_42E9_91BB_EC8BBFACE885"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to look back upon the past ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ might have had,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫已经逝去的往昔，⟪k:1⟫只是残留着破碎幸福的时光。"

#: badend:badend_EAA90AAE_67A8_4496_8BA6_AE73C80B00D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f73a5aa9d098fb805d6e84418ee010b8d3d0df500a8d54d11e520719833182c
#. default-sha256: 4adbaa0f7632a30d0725a1ecee23c5a4dbb9bbb27921d9aff05e9da14d916eb5
msgctxt "badend:badend_EAA90AAE_67A8_4496_8BA6_AE73C80B00D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the rare, treasured days of happiness,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫已经逝去的往昔，⟪k:1⟫只是充斥遍体伤疤的日夜。"

#: badend:badend_56C479A0_7DFD_4EE0_9FFF_322BDA18E0A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf64e4fe2ca95e32563a1f6509b2d065c828ecb7b02996c17976959a165d4681
#. default-sha256: 4ed183c681d64dd8e9ba6d8f5d6c49e54de04136eff6cee60e01e2de79767e8b
msgctxt "badend:badend_56C479A0_7DFD_4EE0_9FFF_322BDA18E0A2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or the bitter days filled with nothing but pain,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫听毕，⟪k:1⟫「⟪k:2⟫你⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」发现连自己一直苦苦追寻着的那个人——"

#: badend:badend_0DC26A41_A3FA_4FCC_954D_84814ECB3595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85476fdce18c4b342852e9c9c6626e6e10393445ac4649b2c89e22ba35b142b9
#. default-sha256: a45d3d54b077e2ab07b232c2376f023231947a9a9f226ada44066efb7194cba5
msgctxt "badend:badend_0DC26A41_A3FA_4FCC_954D_84814ECB3595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or the person ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ supposed to find."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫都已经，再也回忆不起。"

#: badend:badend_9597D371_8F16_48D8_B133_E897C5ABDA2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff150e0f05e5fe86766f4a7431faa84bb0c82a1d509daf9c5f968c8085b75101
#. default-sha256: a5b827c33e29c530c840123ad68115481bf8adfb5da18239f1195057ab3fff34
msgctxt "badend:badend_9597D371_8F16_48D8_B133_E897C5ABDA2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ fine with that. ⟪k:4⟫There was no one to criticize ⟪k:5⟫"
"You⟪k:6⟫him⟪k:7⟫ for averting ⟪k:8⟫Your⟪k:9⟫his⟪k:10⟫ eyes from ⟪k:11⟫Your⟪k:12⟫his⟪k:13⟫ pain "
"and seizing the opportunity for happiness lying before ⟪k:14⟫You⟪k:15⟫him⟪k:16⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫然而……⟪k:1⟫这已经无所谓了。⟪k:2⟫对于……不想再回顾那些痛苦往事、⟪k:3⟫只渴望能抓住幸福的「⟪k:4⟫"
"你⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫死者⟪k:7⟫」来说，⟪k:8⟫无人可以指责。"

#: badend:badend_3EDA9B4B_D931_44BE_B22D_1D681440EFE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5afcffdc8d87fc178b50ac356cd50064f518b274a12a127c0367d1772f577284
#. default-sha256: 17be57519f0102c730c6fda6f5fb4276e5023be24a7afb0e19a79239d099e9f9
msgctxt "badend:badend_3EDA9B4B_D931_44BE_B22D_1D681440EFE9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ made the correct choice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」做了正确的选择。"

#: badend:badend_A8975700_5290_4EF8_8591_7B9B4986DDFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c5da1a2777b06ec297faa85271f46affe270d7a9376fac56b38e660770b0eb6
#. default-sha256: 8404a3300fdcf68c463849a4f3dbe889fed4a588342498a5009bff7153e7e034
msgctxt "badend:badend_A8975700_5290_4EF8_8591_7B9B4986DDFA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Master... ⟪k:14⟫Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫老爷……⟪k:14⟫老爷。"

#: badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17134ec19278dce1e26687a842a066cec7cc59fcd6018d56e98617df1c5adf66
#. default-sha256: ff81b8259c3e9d1fd6eee3858c582f4a75cd04fba905cfb1b7605f9257f01245
msgctxt "badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, thank goodness. You have awoken.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I was getting worried there for a moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫啊……⟪k:2⟫您终于醒来了。⟪k:3⟫因为刚才怎么叫您都不醒，⟪k:4⟫下仆我，⟪k:5⟫有些束手无策呢。"

#: badend:badend_9DC2F38C_144D_445D_AC6E_F7CB12141173
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49e310ec94e0dc6cc716ad6153a0e8a35c07a1959b72a4d3d4fea3de8e68eaaf
#. default-sha256: 35f861ca23a46822db8d996f5f0e26e43a2438230913e7cbf479c99224dbf5d7
msgctxt "badend:badend_9DC2F38C_144D_445D_AC6E_F7CB12141173"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What kind of herbal tea would you like to start your day with?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have "
"some wonderful chamomile leaves, if you would like."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫老爷需要来杯醒神的香草茶吗？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫馆内还备有上等的春黄菊，⟪k:5⟫推荐老爷试试。"

